skill.prompt_template:
Configure a Traefik route with the following specifications:

Route Configuration:
- Name: {route_name}
- Provider: {provider}
- Rule: {rule}
- Entrypoints: {entrypoints}
- Service URL: {service_url}
- Load Balancer Method: {load_balancer_method}
- Priority: {priority}
- Middlewares: {middlewares}
- TLS Enabled: {tls_enabled}
- TLS Cert Resolver: {tls_certresolver}
- Pass Host Header: {pass_host_header}

Configuration Context:
- Configuration Path: {configuration_path}
- Environment: {environment}

Requirements:
1. Generate valid Traefik v2+ configuration
2. Include appropriate service definition
3. Configure load balancer with health checks
4. Apply middleware chain if specified
5. Validate configuration syntax

Error Handling:
- If provider is unsupported: report available providers
- If rule syntax is invalid: provide corrected syntax with explanation
- If service URL is malformed: report validation error with expected format
- If configuration path is inaccessible: report permissions issue
